Third-party material in ACEAPEX
===============================

ACEAPEX is MIT-licensed (LICENSE). The repository includes the following third-party material.

1. src/xxhash.h - xxHash 0.8.3, the whole header, unmodified (XXH3-64 is the archive checksum).
   Copyright (C) 2012-2023 Yann Collet. BSD 2-Clause License (text below).

2. src/ax_xxh3.h - our code (XXH3-64 split for a GPU); its 192-byte default secret table is taken from xxHash.
   Copyright (C) 2012-2023 Yann Collet. BSD 2-Clause License (text below).

Used but not included (built or downloaded separately, under their own licenses):
   - zstd (libzstd, BSD 3-Clause or GPLv2), linked by the default profile and the CLI;
   - nvCOMP (NVIDIA, proprietary license), optional GPU builds;
   - DietGPU (Meta, MIT), the GPU research programs that #include its headers (setup_pod.sh fetches it);
   - misa77 (MIT) and LZ4 (BSD 2-Clause) objects from the lzbench tree, linked by research/fastblk/fair.cpp.

